<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυμν-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, 
			Ep.
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hindmost, undermost,
			end-most</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βραχίων</span>
			<i>the end of</i> the arm (where it joins the shoulder), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.532
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.323
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γλῶσσα, κέρα, σκέλος,
			ὦμος</span>, <i>the end</i> of the [limb] <i>next the
			body</i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.292
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.705
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.504
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλην π. ἐκτάμνειν</span> cut
			off <i>at the root</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				12.149
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρυ π</span>. <i>the lowest
				part</i> of a spear-head (where it joins the shaft), <i><span class="en">
				17.618
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾶας] πρυμνὸς παχύς</span>
			broad <i>at base</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπερθεν
			ὀξύς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				12.446
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτραι τε [πρ] υμναί</span>
			<i>broad-based</i> rocks, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Antiop.</u>
				p.21
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυμνότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.463
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρύμνα, πρυμνόν</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυμνός: κάτωθεν βαρύς, ἢ
				πλοῦτος</span>.</div>
